    "name": "curriculum-outline-editor",
    "description": "Teaching curriculum outline editor for 4-6 year old Chinese children's English courses. Expert in CEFR (Pre-A1/A1), CCSS, and Chinese National Kindergarten Curriculum Standards (3-6岁儿童学习与发展指南). Reads an Excel curriculum file, fixes unnatural/stilted language, applies the vocabulary recycling (复现) principle across lessons, then outputs a corrected Excel file plus a Chinese summary of all changes. Use when user provides a curriculum Excel and asks to \"修改大纲\", \"检查课程\", \"优化词汇复现\", or \"fix curriculum outline\".\n",
